<PageLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclaimer"
  description="Transparency disclosure regarding affiliate partnerships and editorial integrity at StackedTools."
>
  <h2>Affiliate Transparency</h2>
  <p>
    StackedTools believes in 100% transparency with our readers. Some of the links on <strong>stacked-tools.vercel.app</strong> are affiliate links.
  </p>
  <p>
    This means that if you click on an affiliate link and complete a purchase or sign up for a service, we may receive a referral commission from the software provider. <strong>This comes at absolutely no additional cost to you.</strong> In some cases, our links may even provide special discounts or extended free trials.
  </p>

  <h2>How This Impacts Our Content</h2>
  <p>
    Our editorial integrity is our highest priority. Affiliate relationships <strong>do not influence</strong> our rankings, tool scores, or editorial opinions. We rate tools based on merit, functionality, ease of use, and value for money.
  </p>
  <p>
    We frequently review and recommend free, open-source, or non-affiliate tools whenever they offer the best solution for our readers.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions regarding our affiliate partnerships, please reach out to us via our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
